{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "9dd7986c97558187169dde472297a304b25923fdba582030ea5f7ab3b6430ce4", "ja": "兄ちゃん、兄ちゃん！　今すぐ200万円……\nううん、イッセン万円くらい貸してくれる！？", "zh": "哥哥，哥哥！现在就借我200万日元……  \n不对，大概借我一千万日元，可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f47653b4243c4f5057b02b53c3386ef9a42e2b73ffd6d30ac6b8247de41ff315", "ja": "イッセン……1000万円！？　なんだその金額。\nそんなお金、いったいなにに使うつもりなんだ……。", "zh": "一千万……1000万日元！？那是什么金额啊。\n这么多钱，你到底打算拿来干什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "ee730984508f0e23e240bb3c2f2239a2e47cfa1d690dfae566ff9233a3c5f0ba", "ja": "ふっふっふ、知りたい？　知りたいよね？\nそ・れ・は……劇場専用のおっきい気球を買うのさ！", "zh": "哼哼哼，想知道吗？很想知道吧？\n那、就、是……买一只剧场专用的大气球啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3491270c504ddc6f5129b163acec1e8da86821350e799beb81f0b44f61e997d2", "ja": "気球……ああ、なるほどな。\nこの前、仕事で乗ったから、その影響か。", "zh": "热气球……啊，原来如此。是因为前段时间工作时坐过，所以受到影响了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "f27d0719380e8e952d64264b7d16cd6f55333b6d5b2b2d51418f708ceed850b2", "ja": "そうそう！　ホント楽しかったんだよね～♪\nメーッチャ高く飛んで、景色も最高でさ。", "zh": "对对！真的超级开心～♪\n飞得——高——高的，景色也棒极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "71b21d5651a706b6a8ddb7e1cc9a910232056ca89556c5fdae1a1bc37742c116", "ja": "そしてその時、真美は閃きました……。\nあれでライブすれば、超面白くなるって！", "zh": "就在那时，真美灵光一闪……  \n要是用那个来办演唱会，肯定会超级有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b480d88870fe0d4fb41ca779b5c13acc30826b168c05af28f7be52b7d77e4733", "ja": "まあ、盛り上がりはするだろうな。\nそういう演出もないわけではないと思うし。", "zh": "嗯，气氛确实会热闹起来吧。\n而且我觉得也不是没有那种演出方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "85146ce1b44276a7a28d1e07e2951d98d865431781932f6e924e25349d7d0805", "ja": "でしょ！　でね、その楽しそうなことができる気球が、\n今なら一つ200万円（税込）で買えるんだって！", "zh": "对吧！然后呢，据说这种能做出那么有趣事情的气球，现在一个只要200万日元（含税）就能买到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "ec9c66dfcf130f8ea897ca9256181ee8314af3b704e0cab3d60ba2f57d875641", "ja": "安いよね？　買うしかないっしょ♪\nってことで、とりあえず五つくらい……どう！？", "zh": "很便宜对吧？这肯定得买呀♪\n所以呢，先买个五个左右……怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a456daf23fe6b2805097fdd55125f653f98897df2fb26711762f0c4c9be4afb8", "ja": "どうもなにも……無理に決まってるだろ。\nさすがに気球なんて買えないよ。", "zh": "什么怎么样啊……肯定不行吧。  \n再怎么说，也不可能买热气球啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "f6dda51a6c2f2c0f772c820fc59ad1859b3b35ad1ae293b9ac5a4da56a39ac16", "ja": "ええ～！　兄ちゃんのけちんぼ、守銭奴！　ガガンボ！\nお金大好き、悪代官～！", "zh": "诶诶～！哥哥小气鬼、守财奴！大蚊子！\n最喜欢钱的坏官～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "19bc4c12e9b8ce7183196d4e35ae6941f24ec8aebb2db484edf51ee716d755fb", "ja": "兄ちゃんは見たくないの？\n空の上でキラキラに輝く、真美たちの姿。", "zh": "哥哥不想看吗？\n在天空中闪闪发光的真美她们的身姿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fcec3e773dc4cb7cc1500ed7a46effcd65917fc8f9853e6418641606130de1f5", "ja": "そりゃまぁ、見たくないわけじゃないけど、\nさすがに、その金額はポンと出せないよ。", "zh": "那当然不是不想看，只是那笔钱实在没法一下子拿出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "fdfe8b4d2dc16e16a01ac4e113e44803121456d9318e925926035a4d2ba7c610", "ja": "はぁ……どうやら真美のスーコーな考えは\n兄ちゃんには分からないみたいだね。", "zh": "唉……看来哥哥还是无法理解真美的崇高想法呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "18319a925b29368baaf7c4527171cd12dcc652930e4884408535e6110aa1a350", "ja": "しょうがない。こうなったら、真美が直接\n行くしかないか～。そうと決まったら突撃ーっ！", "zh": "没办法。这样一来，只能由真美亲自出马了吧～。既然决定了，那就冲——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7fbfb3a8d77fa0579217e0dae17887b81da509f80f36c809f4762e2741396a62", "ja": "え？　行くってどこに……おーい、真美！\n真美ー！", "zh": "诶？要去哪儿……喂——真美！\n真美——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1016_null", "source_sha256": "a96bc2a21c3910461443e41821d71b597e0a02095862ce1a9eed27850d1eeae5", "ja": "しばらくして……", "zh": "过了一会儿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "c82d1bb5c2257cc8db44420165697d850d4ed61bad5a546b23bdbe82a07f23a6", "ja": "うわーん、兄ちゃ～ん！　社長に相談したら、\n「はっはっはっ」って笑ってゴマかされちゃったよ～！", "zh": "呜哇——哥哥～！我去找社长商量，结果被他用“哈哈哈”糊弄过去了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0563_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2ba2ac1a0084ed9a85e835f901171ebdee3a8863b9e4636cad4016c340ab3e96", "ja": "（その後、相談して……CGを使った演出で納得して\nもらった。真美の行動力にはたびたび驚かされるな）", "zh": "（之后，我和她商量了一番，她最终接受了使用CG进行演出的方案。真美的行动力真是一次又一次让我惊讶啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
